#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:2
msgid "Backup Settings"
msgstr "Backup Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Backup settings page allows you enable or disable scheduled backups, "
"select a default backup bucket, and administer global settings related to "
"backups. Changes to global settings only affect new backups going forward "
"and do not affect existing backups."
msgstr ""
"El Backup configuración página permite usted enable o disable scheduled "
"backups, seleccionar a predeterminado backup bucket, y administer global "
"configuración relacionado con backups. Changes a global configuración solo "
"affect nuevo backups going forward y hacer no affect existente backups."

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:6
msgid ""
"Appliance backups are subject to a two-hour time limit to complete the "
"backup. Automated backup attempts will be abandoned and will fail once this "
"time limit is exceeded."
msgstr ""
"Appliance backups son subject a a two-hour time limit a complete el backup. "
"Automated backup attempts será abandoned y va a fail once este time limit es"
" exceeded."

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:8
msgid ""
"Appliances with an HA architecture containing multiple app nodes must ensure"
" all nodes can access stored backups. By default, if no \"Default Backup "
"Bucket\" configuration is made, backups are stored in "
"``/var/opt/morpheus/bitcan``. If this path is local to the app nodes, all "
"other app nodes would not be able to reach the backups. In such a case, one "
"solution would be to create an NFS share for the ``bitcan`` directory for "
"all app nodes. Another solution would be to make a \"Default Backup Bucket\""
" configuration selection, which all nodes would then use for backup storage "
"and retrieval."
msgstr ""
"Appliances con un HA architecture containing múltiples app nodes debe "
"asegurar todos nodes puede acceso stored backups. De forma predeterminada, "
"si no \"Predeterminado Backup Bucket\" configuración es made, backups son "
"stored en ``/var/opt/morpheus/bitcan``. Si este path es local a el app "
"nodes, todos otro app nodes would no be able a reach el backups. En such a "
"case, uno solution would be a crear un NFS share para el ``bitcan`` "
"directory para todos app nodes. Another solution would be a make a "
"\"Predeterminado Backup Bucket\" configuración selection, que todos nodes "
"would then usar para backup storage y retrieval."

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:11
msgid "|morpheus| Backup Settings"
msgstr "|morpheus| Backup Configuración"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:14
msgid "Scheduled Backups"
msgstr "Scheduled Backups"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:14
msgid "Enable automatic scheduled backups for provisioned instances"
msgstr "Enable automatic scheduled backups para provisioned instancias"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:17
msgid "Create Backups"
msgstr "Crear Backups"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:17
msgid ""
"When enabled, |morpheus| will automatically configure instances for manual "
"or scheduled backups"
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, |morpheus| va a automáticamente configure instancias"
" para manual o scheduled backups"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:20
msgid "Backup Appliance"
msgstr "Backup Appliance"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:20
msgid ""
"When enabled, a backup will be created for the |morpheus| appliance "
"database. Select the ``Backup`` text link to view or edit settings related "
"to the appliance backup"
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, a backup será creado para el |morpheus| appliance "
"database. Seleccione el ``Backup`` text link a view o editar configuración "
"relacionado con el appliance backup"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:23
msgid "Default Backup Bucket"
msgstr "Predeterminado Backup Bucket"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:23
msgid ""
"Select an existing bucket as the default for future backup runs. Click the "
"``Infrastructure Storage`` text link to add a new storage bucket to "
"|morpheus| if needed"
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar un existente bucket as el predeterminado para future backup "
"runs. Haga clic en el ``Infrastructure Storage`` text link a agregar a nuevo"
" storage bucket a |morpheus| si needed"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:26
msgid "Default Backup Schedule"
msgstr "Predeterminado Backup Schedule"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:26
msgid ""
"Choose a default schedule interval for automated backups. The available "
"selections in this dropdown menu are Execution Schedules defined in "
"|LibAutExe|"
msgstr ""
"Choose a predeterminado schedule interval para automated backups. El "
"disponible selections en este menú desplegable menu son Execution Schedules "
"defined en |LibAutExe|"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:29
msgid "Default Backup Retention"
msgstr "Predeterminado Backup Retention"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:29
msgid ""
"Choose the default number of backups to be retained for automated Instance "
"and appliance backup jobs"
msgstr ""
"Choose el predeterminado número de backups a be retained para automated "
"Instancia y appliance backup jobs"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:32
msgid "Default Synthetic Full Backup enabled"
msgstr "Predeterminado Synthetic Full Backup habilitado"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:32
msgid ""
"When enabled, full synthetic backups will be on by default in addition to "
"standard backups for supported workload types"
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, full synthetic backups será en de forma "
"predeterminada además de standard backups para soportado cargas de trabajo "
"tipos"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:34
msgid "Default Synthetic Full Backup Schedule"
msgstr "Predeterminado Synthetic Full Backup Schedule"

#: ../../administration/settings/backup_settings.rst:35
msgid ""
"Choose a default schedule interval for full synthetic backups. The available"
" selections in this dropdown menu are Execution Schedules defined in "
"|LibAutExe|"
msgstr ""
"Choose a predeterminado schedule interval para full synthetic backups. El "
"disponible selections en este menú desplegable menu son Execution Schedules "
"defined en |LibAutExe|"
